{"Map-Title":"03: Deliverance","Map-Author":"Darkademic","Map-Categories-Mission":"Campaign","Map-Briefing":"Our operations against the Soviets have been going well as of late, however their next move may be one of desperation.\n\nThere is a GDI base under heavy attack from Soviet forces not far from here. We suspect they were sent to secure the area at the same time as us.\n\nFind the base and do what you can to save their commander.\n\nTime is short, commander."}
